{
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.FantasizeBase": "You wonder how you could fuck something so large. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.FantasizeBigCock": "Oh wait, you could just fuck his ass with your "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.FantasizeBigCockNose": "He might have a nice nose... You try to get a size of his nose. He's too far away to gauge it"
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.FantasizeMulti": "collection of dicks. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.FantasizeNoCock": "You could just crawl onto some part of him and rub, though he looks very cold to be doing something like that. You wonder if there's not a way to fuck something else... Maybe his nose? You can't tell if it has a prominent tip from here"
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.FantasizeSingle": " one really big cock. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.FantasizeSmallCock": "You suppose you could try to fuck a smaller hole that's not usually used for sex... Maybe his nose? You can't quite make out the size of his nostrils from here"
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.Hit0": "You charge at the giant, running as fast as you can, hoping to get to him before he can throw the huge rock. However, you getting closer just makes it easier for him to hit you, and he does, the full force of the boulder hitting your upper body square-on, whipping you directly down into the snow while the boulder mercifully lands some yards away. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.Hit1": ", but you do look up just in time to nearly avoid the large boulder he chucked your way. Scrambling to react, you jump to the side, only to realize you chose the wrong side. The boulder hits you in the back, propelling you. Battered, beaten, bruised, you struggle to stand, when the giant picks you up, laughs in his deep, mighty bellow, and punts you over a mountain. You land several feet deep in a snowbank, and see something flying toward you before your vision flickers. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.Hit2": "You begin to cast, focusing intently on summoning your magic. Too focused, though, as the giant propels the boulder in an arc to you. You notice the boulder just in time to not be crushed by it, though it still hits you and you fly several dozen yards before hitting a nice, jagged rock face."
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.Miss": "His aim was perfect, if you had stood still. Watching him throw it at you gave you all the time you needed to avoid the large rock, though the debris from the impact might leave some bruises. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.Throw1": "The giant walks over to a boulder much larger than you and hefts it up. You had better wait and be ready to dodge, or this could be very bad. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Boulder.Throw2": "<b>With a grunt and a shove, the giant throws the boulder directly at you!</b>"
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Grab.DodgeAbly": "You ably avoid his charge, jumping just in time to avoid his hands, and then his feet. He's unable to stop himself in time and collides head first with a boulder slightly smaller than his head."
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Grab.DodgeBarely": "You barely avoid his charge, jumping just in time to avoid his hands, and then his feet. He's unable to stop himself in time and collides head first with a boulder slightly smaller than his head."
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Grab.GiantStunned": " <b>The giant is stunned!</b>"
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Grab.Hit": "Your attempt to make way fails, and the giant grabs you in his very large, very cold, very strong hands. [say: Now, you die!]"
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Grab.Lead": "The giant yells something you don't understand and charges at you, hands outstretched! "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.Bondage": "The thought of being constricted turns you on a bit. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.GroundPound1": "The giant brings you to his face to yell at you. His scream is probably the loudest thing you've ever heard, and while your ears are still ringing he raises you up, and up, and up and then punches the ground with all his might. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.GroundPound2": "The force of the punch leaves you reeling for a time; you come to your senses before he tries to do anything else."
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.Str20": "The giant's grip nearly crushes you to bits right there; sheer force of will allows you to struggle and resist, though it proves futile."
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.Str40": "Try as you might, the giant's grip is too much for your weak body; the best you can do is a few squirms and a shake. His grip remains as tough as ever. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.Str60": "Your strength fails to help you escape this frosty situation, though the heat from the struggle is nice enough in this wasteland to nearly doze in it. The giant makes sure that doesn't happen, though. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.Str80": "You push and pull and squeeze and worm with all your might, but all that does is make the giant's grip harder. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.StrLow": "The giant squeezes you mercilessly, the pressure on your body reaching critical levels. The giant doesn't seem to want to murder you, fortunately, so he lessens his grip slightly. No dice escaping it though."
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.Taunt": "[say: Ha, ha, ha! Puny little [race]! You cannot escape my grasp!] He flicks your head, nearly snapping your neck, and you see stars for a moment."
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabFail.Throw": "[say: Oh, little [race] wants to be let go? Ha! Then GO!] He rears back and chucks you as hard as he can against the nearest rock face. Fortunately, his aim is off and he throws you into a patch of snow. The snow helps cushion the impact, but you're still very disoriented."
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabSuccess.Str100": "You roar and force the giant's hand open. He gasps in surprise, using his other hand to close you in, but it's too late by then. You jump to the ground and roll away, readying for your next attack. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabSuccess.Str20": "Body aching, you exploit a light grip for a moment and drop to the ground with a hard thud. Forcing yourself to get up and MOVE, you run as quickly as your throbbing [ass] can handle. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabSuccess.Str40": "Despite the cold, hard confines of the giant's hand, you manage to slip out of his hand and fall to the ground before scrambling up and running from the angry giant. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabSuccess.Str60": "With no small effort, you pop out from the giant's clench. You run up his arm and jump down his back, making distance. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabSuccess.Str80": "You push, pull, squeeze, squirm and finally you escape the giant's grasp. You drop and roll and make distance before readying your weapon. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.GrabSuccess.StrLow": "Struggling with every fiber of your being, you manage to tickle the giant into dropping you. Slightly embarrassed, you get as far away from the giant without running away as you can, and ready your weapon. You think it wise to try to escape. "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Punch.HitFull": "You take the full force of his grand slam, sending you flying a good 40 feet, plunging through a snowdrift. As you right yourself, his laugh shakes the ground, [say: Puny! Haaaa!]"
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Punch.HitGlance": "You nearly avoid the giant's fist, stumbling as you regain your footing. The giant's growl is a deep bass as he bellows, [say: Bah! Luck!]"
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Punch.Lead": "The giant strides toward you, closing the distance faster than you can run. He rears back and strikes at you! "
  "Combat.FrostGiant.Punch.Miss": "You deftly dodge the jumbo Jotun's paltry punch, spinning swiftly to charge your [weapon] at his hand, leaving what looks like a crack. The giant roars in outrage, shaking snow from trees and making your [armor] vibrate. He appears angrier than before."
}
